<div id="A4.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">We present the generated plan for the indoor navigation task below, which satisfies all the natural language rules with probabilistic guarantees above 90 percent. We present the real execution of the plan in Figure <a href="#S7.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ 7.1 Rule Compliance Prediction ‣ 7 Quantitative Analysis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> (right).</p>
